"regime -- rather than `node.astext()` or a raw f-string interpolation (V5"
" Input Validation, Pitfall 7)."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.depart_abbreviation:10
msgid ""
"FID-14: the auto-generated PEP 3102 keyword-only (\"*\") and PEP 570 "
"positional-only (\"/\") signature separators are represented as an "
"`abbreviation` node whose OWN visible text is exactly \"*\" or \"/\" -- "
"the sole reliable, narrow-scope signal (no distinguishing classes/ids "
"exist). Suppress the appended explanation ONLY for those two exact cases;"
" a genuine `:abbr:` role's acronym text is never bare \"*\"/\"/\", so it "
"keeps its inline expansion unchanged (D-Disc-3)."
msgstr ""

