#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_desc_sig_operator:3
msgid ""
"Stays a no-op: self.in_signature_text already gives this node's Text "
"children monospace via visit_Text's branch (contract section 4.3) -- no "
"dedicated handler is needed. Not given the flatten-and-skip shortcut "
"either: the keyword-only separator operator was measured to wrap an "
"abbreviation node, and flattening it buys nothing while adding a subtree-"
"dropping hazard."
msgstr ""

