#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_literal_emphasis:3
msgid ""
"Emits ``emph(raw(\"<escaped>\"))`` -- italic monospace (FLD-03, 38"
"-EMISSION-CONTRACT.md section 5.2 row 2), deliberately DIFFERENT from the"
" signature family's own type recipe (D-05): the reference's own recipe "
"for a field-body parameter type, distinct from the plain-bold "
"proportional field label. Delegates to "
":meth:`_emit_field_body_monospace_leaf`, which raises ``nodes.SkipNode`` "
"-- ``depart_literal_emphasis`` is therefore never called (mirrors "
"``visit_literal`` / ``depart_literal``)."
